id: pm-ado-coverage-node-options
title: Cover the coverage runner fallback with Node options set
description: "The required WAN NODE_OPTIONS value leaves the fallback branch at scripts/coverage-gate.ts:288 unexercised. Archived origin/main coverage-runner tests passed 31/31 in both controls and measured 99.18% branches with the WAN override and 100% without it. The feature package run passed all 1644 tests, then stopped at 99.96% branches before the independent statement pass."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: coverage,testing
created_at: "2026-11-18T16:04:34.344Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T18:20:37.119Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Exercise inherited and absent NODE_OPTIONS in the existing coverage-runner tests; preserve the WAN options for network tests and retain the configured coverage thresholds.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T17:20:58.977Z",codex-sol,"Round DV reproduced this at full package scope under the required network NODE_OPTIONS. All 1646 quick-depth tests passed and the V8 gate stopped at 99.96% branches. Only the absent-options branch in scripts/coverage-gate.ts was uncovered. Extend the existing coverage fixture to exercise absent NODE_OPTIONS, scoped to the fixture. The existing inherited-options fixture remains in place."
  "2026-11-19T17:22:16.637Z",codex-sol,"With the same exported NODE_OPTIONS, the 31 coverage-runner tests pass and measure 100% V8 lines, branches and functions for scripts/coverage-gate.ts. The existing inherited-options case and the isolated absent-options case both pass."
  "2026-11-19T18:20:34.011Z",codex-sol,Code commit c7716c1 exercised both Node option paths. The full V8 and focused rerun reports reconcile to 100% across all 14 package gate sources. Independent production Istanbul on the rebased quick suite passed 1646 tests with 2556/2556 statements. This is verification by component after the fixture fix.
files[2]{path,scope}:
  scripts/coverage-gate.ts,project
  test/coverage-gate.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test --experimental-test-coverage --test-coverage-include=scripts/coverage-gate.ts --test-coverage-lines=100 --test-coverage-branches=100 --test-coverage-functions=100 test/coverage-gate.test.ts,project,codex-sol,"2026-11-19T17:21:56.678Z",local_mutation,fix/release-check-duration
docs[1]{path,scope}:
